OL,3,GNEWSAMigrant hotel protester has
OL,4,Ayear-long wait for trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has to wait more than a year
OL,7,Ffor her trial on charges of assaulting
OL,8,Fa man and damaging his GoPro microphone
OL,9,Fduring protests outside The Bell asylum
OL,10,Fseekers hotel in Essex in 2025.
OL,12,FJoanne Winter, 29, was part of a
OL,13,Fcounter-demonstration outside the hotel
OL,14,Fin Epping on 27 July last year that was
OL,15,Fresponding to anti-migrant protests.
OL,17,FAt Chelmsford Magistrates' Court, she
OL,18,Fspoke to confirm her name, age, date of
OL,19,Fbirth and her not guilty plea to
OL,20,Fcharges of assault and criminal damage,
OL,21,Fwhich she first entered in October last
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
