OL,3,GNEWSAMigrant hotel protester has
OL,4,Ayear-long wait for trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FWinter, of Tylney Road in Sheffield and
OL,7,Fformerly of Deptford in south-east
OL,8,FLondon, is to remain on unconditional
OL,9,Fbail ahead of a trial at the same court
OL,10,Fon 3 December 2027.
